    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>What our students say</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
                <div class="ab_img">
                    <img src="~/assets/img/review.png" class="img-fluid" alt="">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
                <div id="testimonial-slider" class="owl-carousel">
                    <div class="testimonial">
                        <img src="~/assets/img/quote.png" alt="" />
                        <div class="testimonial_content">
                            <i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i>
                            <p>I went from blanking out in meetings to chairing them in English. The B2 → C1 track was exactly what I needed.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi_pic_title">
                            <img src="~/assets/img/testimonial/1.png" alt="">
                            <h4>Maria P.</h4>
                            <p>Project Manager · Bucharest</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="testimonial">
                        <img src="~/assets/img/quote.png" alt="" />
                        <div class="testimonial_content">
                            <i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i>
                            <p>Passed FCE on the first attempt. The mock exams and tutor feedback made the difference.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi_pic_title">
                            <img src="~/assets/img/testimonial/2.png" alt="">
                            <h4>Andrei I.</h4>
                            <p>Student · Cluj</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="testimonial">
                        <img src="~/assets/img/quote.png" alt="" />
                        <div class="testimonial_content">
                            <i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i><i class="ti-star"></i>
                            <p>The Conversation Club is what finally made me stop overthinking every sentence. Worth every cent.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi_pic_title">
                            <img src="~/assets/img/testimonial/3.png" alt="">
                            <h4>Elena C.</h4>
                            <p>Designer · Chișinău</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
